  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://kvsangathan.nic.in/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan (KVS)</a> and <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://navodaya.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Navodaya Vidyalaya Sangathan (NVS)</a></span> has released the Tier-II Answer Key for the post of Teaching and Non-Teaching in various subjects and various posts. This recruitment was released for 15,762 posts. Applications for the KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 were accepted from November 14, 2025, to December 11, 2025. The Tier-II examination was conduct on 27-31 March 2026. Candidates who had appeared in Tier-I Examination can download their KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan (KVS) and Navodaya Vidyalaya Sangathan (NVS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Tier-II Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>14 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>14 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>11 December 2025 (Extend)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date<strong>&nbsp;: 13-15 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>11 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 10 – 11 January 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details&nbsp;<strong> : 26 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card<strong> : 08 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key <strong>: 31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tier-I Result : <strong>28 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam Date : <strong>27-31 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Exam City Details : <strong>10 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Admit Card : <strong>23 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tier-II Answer Key : <strong>13 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Assistant Commissioner / Principal / Vice Principal :-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :<strong> Rs. 2800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM :<strong> Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>PGT/ TGT/ PRT/ AE/ Finance Officer/ AO/ Librarian/ ASO/ Jr Translator :-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :<strong> Rs. 2000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM :<strong> Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>SSA / Stenographer / JSA / Lab Attendant / Multi-Tasking Staff :-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :<strong> Rs. 1700/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, PH, ESM :<strong> Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As Per Rule</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 – 50 Years Post Wise</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 14,967 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Commissioner in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">13</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Commissioner in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Principal (Equivalent to Group-A)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">161</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Principal in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">93</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Vice-Principal in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">69</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduate Teachers (PGTs) in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1606</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduate Teachers (PGTs) in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">1513</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Post Graduate Teachers (PGTs) (Modern Indian Language) in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">18</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trained Graduate Teachers (TGTs) in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3069</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Librarian in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">147</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trained Graduate Teachers (TGTs) in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">2978</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Trained Graduate Teachers (3rd Language) in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">443</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Primary Teachers (PRTs) in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">3630</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Non-Teaching Posts in KVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">805</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Non-Teaching Posts in NVS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">787</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>KVS NVS Teaching &amp; Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have passed&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"133\">10th / 12th</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"149\">Graduation</strong>, or&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"173\">Post Graduation</strong> in any discipline from any recognized board / university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>For Post Wise Eligibility Detail – </strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before a